WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:06.920
DC Comics has a number of technological artifacts
that are fundamentally important to understanding

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.130
many of its greatest stories.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.540
Chief among them are the Mother Boxes.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.950
From their mythical origins to their incredible
powers, here's everything you need to know

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.559
about DC's Mother Boxes.

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:25.063
Before you can understand Mother Boxes, it's
useful to take a detour to understand DC's New Gods.

00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:29.872
About 18 billion years ago, there was a world
named GodWorld.

00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:35.550
As the planet evolved, humanoid beings sprang
forth and developed vastly powerful abilities

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.210
over billions of years.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:41.920
Eventually, they became gods, aka the Old
Gods.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.720
GodWorld fell into internal conflict between
factions of gods, culminating in GodWorld's

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:52.823
destruction and a massive wave of energy,
the Godwave, spreading throughout the universe.

00:00:52.823 --> 00:00:57.730
The remnants of GodWorld itself eventually
turned into two distinct planets.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:02.660
On the one hand, there's the utopian New Genesis,
ruled by the virtuous Highfather.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:08.049
On the other, there's the evil and dark Apokolips,
where tyranny and war reign.

00:01:08.049 --> 00:01:12.069
These planets become home to a new set of
deities, the New Gods.

00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:16.319
The New Gods of New Genesis are, of course,
generally wise and just.

00:01:16.319 --> 00:01:21.539
Those on Apokolips, who eventually come to
be ruled by the tyrant Darkseid, are devoted

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:25.829
to universal conquest and tyranny under his
malevolent hand.

00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:30.770
Each planet has developed considerably advanced
science and technologies, but the most unique

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:36.029
and complex inventions of the New Gods are
the mysterious Mother Boxes, the sentient

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:39.453
supercomputers that can do nearly anything.

00:01:39.453 --> 00:01:44.350
Mother Boxes owe their existence to the New
Gods that inhabit New Genesis.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:49.399
Specifically, New Genesis scientist Himon
develops the Mother Boxes as small, portable,

00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:50.798
sentient supercomputers.

00:01:50.798 --> 00:01:56.060
And as for Himon, he becomes the headmaster
of the Academy of Higher Conscience before

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:01.648
eventually living undercover on Apokolips
and fomenting rebellion against Darkseid.

00:02:01.648 --> 00:02:08.631
As sentient technology, each Mother Box is
its own unique entity and has an independent will of its own.

00:02:08.631 --> 00:02:13.740
And they get their name for the unconditional
"motherly love" they have for their users.

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:18.829
Plus, Mother Boxes were made as a result of
experiments with the mysterious Element X,

00:02:18.829 --> 00:02:25.772
DC's Tenth Metal, which can be manipulated
by thought alone and which powers most New God technology.

00:02:25.772 --> 00:02:29.473
Element X first appeared in New Gods #7.

00:02:29.473 --> 00:02:35.390
In effect, the whole multiverse is a very
diluted form of this Tenth Metal, and access

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:38.440
to the metal grants powers beyond comprehension.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:45.485
And since the Mother Boxes come from experiments
involving Element X, these devices are incredibly dangerous.

00:02:45.485 --> 00:02:50.719
While it's admittedly mysterious how exactly
they work, Mother Boxes are also known to

00:02:50.719 --> 00:02:55.989
have connection to the Source, the literal
source of all that exists and the infinite

00:02:55.989 --> 00:02:58.783
energy that produced all life in the universe.

00:02:58.783 --> 00:03:01.847
"She is a living computer connected to the
source."

00:03:01.847 --> 00:03:06.970
Their complexity means that they can't truly
be "made" by beings outside New Genesis or

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:11.775
Apokolips, and very few New Gods have ever
been able to successfully create them.

00:03:11.775 --> 00:03:16.230
It's even said that the creator's personality
becomes a part of the resulting Mother Box,

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:20.774
making them one of the DC Universe's most
mysterious artifacts.

00:03:20.774 --> 00:03:24.780
Mother Boxes are enormously powerful artifacts.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:30.430
As such, their potential is maybe limitless
and certainly wide-ranging, and they've been

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:34.670
utilized by the New Gods for nearly any purpose
you can imagine.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:39.720
Mother Boxes have been used to amplify their
user's own powers to considerable degrees,

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.858
and it doesn't seem to matter much what those
powers are.

00:03:42.858 --> 00:03:48.469
Among the myriad powers Mother Boxes have
displayed, they've manipulated a host's mental

00:03:48.469 --> 00:03:54.615
state, allowed telepathic communication, sustained
life in hostile environments, returned hosts

00:03:54.615 --> 00:04:01.306
to life, healed fatal injuries, transferred
energy, and changed an area's gravity on various occasions.

00:04:01.306 --> 00:04:06.609
Mother Boxes can interact with technology,
allowing them to control or "evolve" said

00:04:06.609 --> 00:04:08.666
technology with little effort.

00:04:08.666 --> 00:04:14.549
They've even transmuted matter and energy
or even manipulated dimensions and merged

00:04:14.549 --> 00:04:17.389
independent beings into a composite being.

00:04:17.389 --> 00:04:21.063
They are, indeed, effectively limitless.

00:04:21.063 --> 00:04:26.830
Perhaps their most famous use, however, is
as space-bending transportation devices.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:33.300
Mother Boxes create extra-dimensional transit
tunnels, "Boom Tubes," that allow transit through space.

00:04:33.793 --> 00:04:39.070
While Mother Boxes originate from the New
Gods of New Genesis, Father Boxes emerge as

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:43.940
a similar technology from Apokolips, albeit
with an opposite moral alignment.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:48.280
Father Boxes first appear in 2001's Orion
Vol. 1 # 8.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:53.289
They were originally introduced by Darkseid's
wife, Mortalla, as a "gift" to the heroic

00:04:53.289 --> 00:04:57.280
Orion, evidently presented to replace his
defunct Mother Box.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:02.839
That, of course, was a ruse - it was actually
intended to bring Orion back under Darkseid's control.

00:05:02.839 --> 00:05:09.410
Whereas a Mother Box is said to be "good,"
loving, caring, and are attributed a "maternal"

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:15.259
energy in comic lore, a Father Box is said
to have a "pure evil" persona and is crafted

00:05:15.259 --> 00:05:17.233
to have "male programming."

00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:22.081
Father Boxes exhibit most of the varied uses
that Mother Boxes have showcased in the comics,

00:05:22.081 --> 00:05:24.490
including connection to the Source.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:29.660
However, where Mother Boxes are attached to
the creative, living, positive, good aspects

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:34.550
of the Source, Father Boxes access the more
negative portion of the Source energies related

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:36.734
to its Anti-Life aspect.

00:05:36.734 --> 00:05:42.200
Although Mother Boxes and Father Boxes are
the most prominent examples of the New Gods'

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:48.449
sentient technology, there are also rare examples
of stranger boxes that serve similar functions.

00:05:48.449 --> 00:05:53.265
However, their natures and backstories are
different from your standard Mother and Father Boxes.

00:05:53.265 --> 00:05:58.580
The first of these is the so-called "Orphan
Box," created by Father Time, the mysterious

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:04.665
immortal leader of S.H.A.D.E., a governmental
organization that uses superpowered individuals to fight terrorism.

00:06:04.665 --> 00:06:11.620
Father Time himself has powers, as he is immortal,
possesses super strength, and his body regenerates,

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.726
although it's unclear if he is in fact a New
God.

00:06:14.726 --> 00:06:19.600
Regardless, he creates the Orphan Box from
the remnants of Gonzo the Mechanical Bastard,

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:24.905
a being created by Apokolips' Mathemagicians
of the Anti-Life Equation to spread chaos on Earth.

00:06:24.905 --> 00:06:30.190
Additionally, one future timeline presented
in the JLA: Rock of Ages storyline sees one

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:36.490
of Darkseid's torturous minions, Granny Goodness,
turned into an insane computer called, alternately,

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:40.979
either a "Grandmother Box" or, more succinctly,
a "Granny Box."

